B.aah=new A.co("n14","Isotopic labelling with \xb9\xb3CH4 | confirmed that lattice carbon | entered the product.")
B.aa_=new A.co("n15","The reverse water-gas shift (RWGS) | consumed hydrogen | above 700 \xb0C.")
B.a9S=new A.co("n16","NH3-TPD quantified | 0.42 mmol/g of | moderately strong acid sites.")
