B.aab=new A.co("n19","Rietveld refinement converged | with \u03c7\xb2 of 1.7 | and a weighted R-factor of 4.9%.")
B.aa5=new A.co("n20","Single-atom alloys (SAA) | dissociated methane | without extensive coke formation.")
B.aal=new A.co("n21","Multiwalled carbon nanotubes grew | from coordinatively unsaturated | nickel step edges.")
B.aac=new A.co("n22","The double-layer capacitance was | 28 \u03bcF/cm\xb2 | in one molar potassium hydroxide.")
B.aaf=new A.co("n23","Selectivity toward ethylene | exceeded 71%, | whereas methane stayed below 3%.")
B.a9P=new A.co("n24","Micrographs recorded at 200,000\xd7 | resolved lattice fringes | across the shell.")
B.aap=new A.co("n25","Pyrolysis proceeded at 5 \xb0C/min | under flowing argon | to 900 \xb0C.")
B.aaq=new A.co("n26","The isotherm showed type IV hysteresis, | consistent with | high pore tortuosity.")
